# ===== MMF-007 Git 安全整改（Codex 复核整改项） =====
# 原则：只跟踪源码/配置模板/文档/测试；运行数据、凭据、构建产物、依赖一律不入库。
# 物理文件不受影响（仅取消跟踪）。

# --- 凭据与本地配置 ---
providers.local.json
config/user_settings.json
.env
.env.*
*.key
credentials/
credential_store/

# --- 运行数据与客户资料 ---
runs/
logs/
output/
uploads/
migration_backup/
migration_state.json
**/runs/
**/logs/
**/output/
**/uploads/

# --- 运行时与检查点 ---
runtime/
**/checkpoint/
**/plan_snapshot/
**/provider_unknown_requests.jsonl
**/latency_history.jsonl*

# --- 依赖与构建产物 ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# --- Python 缓存 ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# --- 生成的成果与临时文件 ---
*.docx
*.pptx
*.pdf
*.tmp
temp/
tmp/
*.log
offline_rebuild/

# --- 办公与客户样本（保持在工作区，不入库） ---
*.xlsx
*.zip
